# WingSim-Markers.ReaperOSC: REAPER OSC pattern config for the Wing Simulator (T065).
#
# Copy into REAPER's OSC folder (Preferences > Control/OSC/web > Add > OSC (Open Sound Control)
# > Pattern config: "Open config directory"), then pick "WingSim-Markers" as the pattern config.
# Device IP 127.0.0.1, device port 2223 (the simulator's OSC port). See
# docs/user/reaper-integration.md.
#
# Only marker/region names are sent. REAPER sends the name of the last marker/region at or
# before the play (or edit) cursor whenever it changes; the simulator recalls the scene when the
# name is "WING:<scene name>" or "WING:#<n>" and ignores all other names and repeats.
# Do not also run the "WING - Recall scenes at markers" script, or scenes are recalled twice.

DEVICE_TRACK_COUNT 0
DEVICE_SEND_COUNT 0
DEVICE_RECEIVE_COUNT 0
DEVICE_FX_COUNT 0
DEVICE_FX_PARAM_COUNT 0
DEVICE_FX_INST_PARAM_COUNT 0
DEVICE_MARKER_COUNT 0
DEVICE_REGION_COUNT 0

LAST_MARKER_NAME s/wingsim/marker
LAST_REGION_NAME s/wingsim/region
